{"id":"689f0bebd96c005e7b2490282126d15031c52bb4","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247511","title":"超过 500 行的代码改动， codex 根本无法独立完成。astra 也不行","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"penzi","excerpt":"OpenAI - @penzi - 自回归模型不回归怪不得 OpenAI 要推迟上市","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>自回归模型不回归</p>\n<p>怪不得 OpenAI 要推迟上市</p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-10-10 09:59:58 +08:00\">15h 47m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <div><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/64HacpA.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/64HacpA.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpRclIF.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpRclIF.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/2KP848m.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2KP848m.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>希望评论的人都可以一直不用 claude ，否则失去的感觉太难受了</p></div>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 2 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-10-10 10:30:05 +08:00\">15h 17m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <p>请大家 block 我，夏虫不可语冰</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/改动\"><li></li> 改动</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a></P><p><span>98 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-10 20:16:23 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162176\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/08d80b0f24f53faf94e0f805afcb1431?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"CodingIran\" data-uid=\"143391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CodingIran\">CodingIran</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:36:51 +08:00\">16h 10m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>什么玩意，公司几十万行代码的项目一直都是用 Codex 开发的，从来没遇到这种问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162197\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7f822e81ea43d153e297782e7a4eb065?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nullyouraise\" data-uid=\"606602\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nullyouraise\">nullyouraise</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:40:03 +08:00\">16h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我改 Chromium 都是 Astra 一把梭，从来没遇到过问题，难以想象你们的项目是有多复杂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162232\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a902/e52b/113902_normal.png?m=1773112193\" alt=\"Finest\" data-uid=\"113902\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Finest\">Finest</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:44:56 +08:00\">16h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>昨天才让 6.1-sol 一次改了 2000 多行代码，真不知道你的项目有多复杂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162234\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/edb7/4af1/545105_normal.png?m=1787231152\" alt=\"MHPSY\" data-uid=\"545105\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MHPSY\">MHPSY</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:45:01 +08:00\">16h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我自己弄了个指纹浏览器 用 claude 5.5 打 patch 改的很好</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162248\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2148/7637/238440_normal.png?m=1696729515\" alt=\"changnet\" data-uid=\"238440\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/changnet\">changnet</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:46:17 +08:00\">16h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>AI 基本只能在已有功能的例子上添加功能。如果没有框架限制，没有例子，尤其是需要扩展、修改原有框架实现时，现有的 AI 确实就是不行，跟代码行数没有太大关系</p><p>或者说 AI 实现得很奇怪，各种 if-else 打补丁。有些明明在基类扩展一个虚函数就很优雅，它偏不。除非不关注代码质量和后续维护，否则很难不人工修改</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162249\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/92699c48c8ccd17d47409bef8f1794be?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xing7673\" data-uid=\"129118\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xing7673\">xing7673</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:46:50 +08:00\">16h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>降智了吧，现在黑 codex 都已经泥沙俱下了么？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162260\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/949c/6242/379232_normal.png?m=1715334244\" alt=\"DOOMS\" data-uid=\"379232\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/DOOMS\">DOOMS</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:49:28 +08:00\">15h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不知道的以为是去年发的帖子。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162262\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d573e4451bde17bdf0b849ee34dfb04b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"penzi\" data-uid=\"491066\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/penzi\">penzi</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:50:03 +08:00\">15h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/64HacpA.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/64HacpA.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>随便找个三分钟前的例子，一次判断都做不好的模型，长任务的结果会是怎样？</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162267\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2f59b786fd9cd2ec2b95720531ebbe83?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Y25tIGxpdmlk\" data-uid=\"623288\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Y25tIGxpdmlk\">Y25tIGxpdmlk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:50:51 +08:00\">15h 56m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 9</span>\n                    \n                    <p>求大神让我们见识一下超高质量的项目代码（不简单的项目），学习一下。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162317\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3c712722e916f5291cfc7ce12adda91a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Dk2014\" data-uid=\"61509\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Dk2014\">Dk2014</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 09:58:14 +08:00\">15h 49m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这个页面怎么跟 codex 不一样😅<br>o/前段时间本来就在治中转，并发多了就降智<br>你不会开了转发来用的吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162341\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c50bb7e3a9c3a139eef1ca5b24c84313?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zeroFans\" data-uid=\"192108\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zeroFans\">zeroFans</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:01:15 +08:00\">15h 46m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>至少用上官方的 codex 再说话吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162348\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/debfeb166f8f6cd4eebe9a9791d457d0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"haoooooooo\" data-uid=\"438212\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/haoooooooo\">haoooooooo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:01:59 +08:00\">15h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>哥们，你是认真的吗？确定不是用的什么山寨 Codex ？<br>虽说 Astra 比不上 Opus5.5 ，但是也没不堪到这种地步。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162369\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fe6a807d9d5e26ce01705a1cd025aef0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"alamaya\" data-uid=\"174482\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/alamaya\">alamaya</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:05:30 +08:00\">15h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 需要有一个比较好的编码规范给到他才行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162372\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a8d46319be1e500109b0d41186eed619?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"icelas259\" data-uid=\"423716\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/icelas259\">icelas259</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:05:41 +08:00\">15h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这是掺水模型吧。先去订阅官方的 codex 看看。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162397\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/73e277ede9ab6879dd1344efbfd7ca05?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"StarsunYzL\" data-uid=\"53245\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/StarsunYzL\">StarsunYzL</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:08:41 +08:00\">15h 38m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 33</span>\n                    \n                    <p>送人头 block ，但凡对当前的 AI 能力有一丁点认知+有一丁点思考能力的都会反思和反复验证自己哪里出问题了而不是下这种不过脑子的结论</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162433\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a1ec/b130/382648_normal.png?m=1688033094\" alt=\"sima675\" data-uid=\"382648\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sima675\">sima675</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:14:02 +08:00\">15h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一个用中转站的就不要评论了，自己被卖了也不知道</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162467\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6013/4fcc/487328_normal.png?m=1785307120\" alt=\"xylxAdai\" data-uid=\"487328\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xylxAdai\">xylxAdai</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:18:54 +08:00\">15h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你用的什么垃圾中转站啊。500 行都改不动。你用半年前的 glm 都不至于五百行改不了。更别提 codex 了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162512\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/63c306cd795f455727bd8a0aca63a98c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"furlxy\" data-uid=\"334784\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/furlxy\">furlxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:25:07 +08:00\">15h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这个智能机器人是个什么？<br>中转被偷换了模型，自己不知道么？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162539\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/06bc/eb98/679304_normal.png?m=1782664383\" alt=\"osilinka\" data-uid=\"679304\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/osilinka\">osilinka</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:27:59 +08:00\">15h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>ms build, 肯定是微软的系统，如果没有足够的 training 材料，肯定是这样啊</p><p>现在都把 AI 看的太聪明了</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162543\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/47bd/cd89/668742_normal.png?m=1766129595\" alt=\"Satoshl\" data-uid=\"668742\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Satoshl\">Satoshl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:28:16 +08:00\">15h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>截图中转站绷不住了，自己还能发出来</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162549\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f178/a1b8/133660_normal.png?m=1789607756\" alt=\"Haku\" data-uid=\"133660\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Haku\">Haku</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:28:53 +08:00\">15h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/penzi\">penzi</a> #14 随机数测试只能在 GPT 内的模型进行，告诉你是否产生了 GPT 内的模型降级（例如 6.1 SOL 可能使用 luna 回复），如果你接的是中转站，给你注水成 DS 或者别的模型，随机数测试是分辨不出来的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18162557\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ec59/2661/58295_normal.png?m=1675744117\" alt=\"laodao\" data-uid=\"58295\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/laodao\">laodao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 10:30:08 +08:00\">15h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你家 codex 叫智能